1
00:00:00,038 --> 00:00:04,882
Kaisar Tiongkok pernah memberi cengkeh dari
Maluku ke pejabat tua yang bau mulut...

2
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:07,848
tapi dia malah mengira itu racun!

3
00:00:07,848 --> 00:00:09,640
Lidahnya pedas menyengat.

4
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,270
Dia takut dihukum mati...

5
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,957
lalu pamit ke keluarganya.

6
00:00:12,957 --> 00:00:15,381
Rekan-rekannya mencicipi racun itu...

7
00:00:15,381 --> 00:00:17,100
ternyata cuma cengkeh,

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,408
pengharum napas!

9
00:00:18,408 --> 00:00:21,536
Padahal hampir 1.900 tahun lalu,

10
00:00:21,536 --> 00:00:25,100
cengkeh sedunia cuma tumbuh
di pulau-pulau kecil Maluku...

11
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,071
4.000 kilometer jauhnya!

12
00:00:27,071 --> 00:00:27,668
Follow,

13
00:00:27,668 --> 00:00:29,988
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
